				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://alwaldend.com/docs/projects/activitywatch_ingester_android/releases/head/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;accordion mt-2&#34; id=&#34;release-09ed6f8d8f0f2c34f70d7c16459b7324-page-0_accordion&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;accordion-header&#34; id=&#34;release-09ed6f8d8f0f2c34f70d7c16459b7324-page-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button&#xA;        class=&#34;accordion-button&#34;&#xA;        type=&#34;button&#34;&#xA;        data-bs-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34;&#xA;        data-bs-target=&#34;#release-09ed6f8d8f0f2c34f70d7c16459b7324-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;        aria-expanded=&#34;true&#34;&#xA;        aria-controls=&#34;release-09ed6f8d8f0f2c34f70d7c16459b7324-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;      &gt;Changelog&lt;span class=&#34;badge rounded-pill bg-secondary ms-1&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&#xA;      id=&#34;release-09ed6f8d8f0f2c34f70d7c16459b7324-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;accordion-collapse collapse show&#34;&#xA;      aria-labelledby=&#34;release-09ed6f8d8f0f2c34f70d7c16459b7324-page-0&#34;&#xA;      data-bs-parent=&#34;#release-09ed6f8d8f0f2c34f70d7c16459b7324-page-0_accordion&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-body&#34;&gt;&lt;ul class=&#34;list-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;li class=&#34;list-group-item my-auto&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;Manage forge resources with hermetic Terraform rules&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Centralize organization, repository, and named access configuration in&#xA;infra/repos. Adopt existing GitHub resources, protect master defaults while&#xA;retaining Pages publication on pages, and preserve existing repository&#xA;identities. Manage GitLab one-time imports, the F-Droid metadata fork, and&#xA;default-branch protections through Vault-backed authentication. Forgejo&#xA;consumes the same catalog. Ongoing repository synchronization is deferred.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>head</title>
				<link>https://alwaldend.com/docs/projects/al/releases/head/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://alwaldend.com/docs/projects/al/releases/head/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;accordion mt-2&#34; id=&#34;release-0a118e046f55db876bac8b68ea96694d-page-0_accordion&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;accordion-header&#34; id=&#34;release-0a118e046f55db876bac8b68ea96694d-page-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button&#xA;        class=&#34;accordion-button&#34;&#xA;        type=&#34;button&#34;&#xA;        data-bs-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34;&#xA;        data-bs-target=&#34;#release-0a118e046f55db876bac8b68ea96694d-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;        aria-expanded=&#34;true&#34;&#xA;        aria-controls=&#34;release-0a118e046f55db876bac8b68ea96694d-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;      &gt;Changelog&lt;span class=&#34;badge rounded-pill bg-secondary ms-1&#34;&gt;137&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&#xA;      id=&#34;release-0a118e046f55db876bac8b68ea96694d-page-0_collapse&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;accordion-collapse collapse show&#34;&#xA;      aria-labelledby=&#34;release-0a118e046f55db876bac8b68ea96694d-page-0&#34;&#xA;      data-bs-parent=&#34;#release-0a118e046f55db876bac8b68ea96694d-page-0_accordion&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-body&#34;&gt;&lt;ul class=&#34;list-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;li class=&#34;list-group-item my-auto&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;Restore light and dark site canvases and set the shared accent&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The shared Docsy canvas set the same Bootstrap dark palette and the same&#xA;black page background on &lt;code&gt;:root&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;[data-bs-theme=&amp;quot;light&amp;quot;]&lt;/code&gt;, and&#xA;&lt;code&gt;[data-bs-theme=&amp;quot;dark&amp;quot;]&lt;/code&gt;, so the light/dark toggle changed nothing. The site&#xA;also rendered Bootstrap&amp;rsquo;s stock blue instead of its intended accent.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Split the shared palette so light mode uses a pure white canvas with the&#xA;light-mode palette and dark mode uses a pure black canvas with the dark-mode&#xA;palette, and keep the pre-stylesheet paint and footer on the active mode.&#xA;Assign &lt;code&gt;$primary&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;#7c3aed&lt;/code&gt; before Bootstrap compiles, so links, buttons,&#xA;badges, focus rings, and the dark-mode link tint all derive from one value&#xA;rather than from a site-local copy.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
